{
  "source": "course-assets/what-is-ai/what-is-ai.mp4",
  "duration": 155.5736875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.82,
      "text": "You need to start your next history project, but you haven't picked a topic."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.54,
      "end": 6.12,
      "text": "You look around the room for inspiration."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.86,
      "end": 10.48,
      "text": "Ask your desk, give me 10 ideas for my next history project."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.38,
      "end": 12.98,
      "text": "Nothing. It's a desk."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.86,
      "end": 16.26,
      "text": "Ask a friend, and they can help you brainstorm."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.28,
      "end": 20.32,
      "text": "Ask AI, and it can give you a list in seconds."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.14,
      "end": 24.74,
      "text": "AI is software built to do things that used to take a human brain."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.5,
      "end": 28.5,
      "text": "It can understand a question, summarize a long document,"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.5,
      "end": 30.22,
      "text": "or translate a conversation."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.24,
      "end": 33.36,
      "text": "That doesn't mean it actually thinks like your friend,"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.88,
      "end": 36.44,
      "text": "or that all 10 of those history ideas will be good."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.24,
      "end": 41.86,
      "text": "You simply have a tool that can help with cognitive tasks that once required a person."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.78,
      "end": 44.48,
      "text": "Different AI systems do different jobs."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.08,
      "end": 47.02,
      "text": "Let's look at two kinds you already use."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.86,
      "end": 50.5,
      "text": "This graphic breaks down these tools into two main categories."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.5,
      "end": 53.32,
      "text": "First is recommendation AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.36,
      "end": 56.34,
      "text": "Its job is to choose from what already exists."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.34,
      "end": 59.08,
      "text": "It works by ranking the available options"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.08,
      "end": 61.8,
      "text": "and selecting the likely best match for you."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.46,
      "end": 65.14,
      "text": "You see this every day when you get a suggested Netflix show,"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.72,
      "end": 67.52,
      "text": "a Spotify song, or a maps route."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.44,
      "end": 69.86,
      "text": "Then there is generative AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 70.84,
      "end": 72.6,
      "text": "Its job is to make something that didn't exist."
    },
    {
      "start": 73.44,
      "end": 76.58,
      "text": "It uses learned patterns to create a new output from your prompt."
    },
    {
      "start": 77.26,
      "end": 80.42,
      "text": "A prompt is simply the question or set of instructions you give it."
    },
    {
      "start": 80.42,
      "end": 83.88,
      "text": "This can result in a brand new email, an essay,"
    },
    {
      "start": 84.56,
      "end": 87.5,
      "text": "an image, a website, a song, or a video."
    },
    {
      "start": 88.54,
      "end": 91.04,
      "text": "AI can recommend AI can create."
    },
    {
      "start": 91.94,
      "end": 93.76,
      "text": "This course focuses on generative AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.64,
      "end": 96.0,
      "text": "Here's what that difference looks like."
    },
    {
      "start": 96.72,
      "end": 100.16,
      "text": "This board shows what happens when we apply both tools to a single scenario."
    },
    {
      "start": 101.1,
      "end": 101.9,
      "text": "You're in the mood for superheroes."
    },
    {
      "start": 103.24,
      "end": 107.7,
      "text": "Recommendation AI takes the scenario and attempts to find a superhero movie you might enjoy."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.7,
      "end": 110.68,
      "text": "Think about how your streaming app handles this kind of request."
    },
    {
      "start": 111.52,
      "end": 113.84,
      "text": "It points you to Captain America Civil War."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.6,
      "end": 117.94,
      "text": "It selected a movie from an existing catalog based on your past interests."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.78,
      "end": 120.28,
      "text": "It picked a movie that already exists."
    },
    {
      "start": 121.28,
      "end": 125.96,
      "text": "Generative AI takes that exact same scenario and writes a brand new scene"
    },
    {
      "start": 125.96,
      "end": 128.02,
      "text": "about two superhero teammates who disagree."
    },
    {
      "start": 128.72,
      "end": 129.2,
      "text": "You get a script."
    },
    {
      "start": 129.92,
      "end": 131.56,
      "text": "We save the bridge, Maya said."
    },
    {
      "start": 132.22,
      "end": 134.64,
      "text": "The hospital loses power in three minutes, Leo replied."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.2,
      "end": 135.74,
      "text": "We can't do both."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.74,
      "end": 138.26,
      "text": "It generated a scene from your request."
    },
    {
      "start": 139.16,
      "end": 140.76,
      "text": "One helps you find something to watch."
    },
    {
      "start": 141.34,
      "end": 143.36,
      "text": "The other helps you create a story of your own."
    },
    {
      "start": 144.08,
      "end": 146.48,
      "text": "This leaves us with a very simple rule to remember."
    },
    {
      "start": 147.2,
      "end": 147.52,
      "text": "Two kinds."
    },
    {
      "start": 148.2,
      "end": 149.32,
      "text": "One picks, one creates."
    },
    {
      "start": 150.24,
      "end": 151.82,
      "text": "This course is about the one that creates."
    }
  ],
